      "en": "Major releases come with a **migration guide**: «Before → After» for each change. Its language includes: `replace X with Y`, `X has been renamed to Y`, `X now defaults to Y`, `X no longer accepts Y`, `you must now …`. Turn it into a checklist for your project."
